    "text": {
     "en": "Welcome to Fun with Shapes. We start with Amma's rangoli made with dots and shapes.\nJoin the dots to make Amma's rangoli. Then name the shapes you see.\nSome shapes are made with curved lines and some with straight lines. Count how many of each.\nMake your own rangoli with cut-outs of shapes and colour it.\nTwo children can compare their rangolis and say how they are the same and how they are different.\nA shape with straight sides has corners. A circle has no corner and no straight side.\nCount the sides and corners of each shape: a triangle has 3 sides and 3 corners, a square has 4 sides and 4 corners."
    }
